# A cooldown from t=0, over `67_rate`'s `plain` and `cooled` (30 s): `cooled`
# fires at 0, is suppressed at 10, fires at 30 as its window ends, and is
# suppressed at 40. "Never fired" is not instant 0. `set 0` states the start.
set 0
pump
assert Sensor entity_id=s reading=1
pump
advance 10000000000
assert Sensor entity_id=s reading=2
pump
advance 20000000000
assert Sensor entity_id=s reading=3
pump
advance 10000000000
assert Sensor entity_id=s reading=4
pump
